  "solution": {
    "text": "<blockquote><p>Given that</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><munder><mi>lim</mi><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow></munder><mfrac><mrow><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow><mi>a</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow></msup><mo>-</mo><mi>cos</mi><mo>(</mo><mi>b</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>)</mo><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>c</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow><mn>2</mn></mfrac><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mi>c</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow></msup></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><mi>cos</mi><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>17</mn></math></p><p>We know that&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow><mi>a</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>a</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mrow><mo>(</mo><mi>a</mi><mi>x</mi><msup><mo>)</mo><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>!</mo></mrow></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mo>&#8230;</mo></math>&nbsp;and&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>cos</mi><mfenced><mrow><mi>b</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mrow><mo>(</mo><mi>b</mi><mi>x</mi><msup><mo>)</mo><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>!</mo></mrow></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mo>&#8230;</mo></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><munder><mi>lim</mi><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow></munder><mfrac><mrow><mfenced><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>a</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mfrac><msup><mfenced><mrow><mi>a</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>!</mo></mrow></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mo>&#8230;</mo></mrow></mfenced><mo>-</mo><mfenced><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><mfrac><msup><mfenced><mrow><mi>b</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>!</mo></mrow></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mo>&#8230;</mo></mrow></mfenced><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>c</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mfenced><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><mfenced><mrow><mi>c</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mfrac><msup><mfenced><mrow><mi>c</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>!</mo></mrow></mfrac><mo>-</mo><mo>&#8230;</mo></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mfenced><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><mi>cos</mi><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi></mrow><msup><mfenced><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup></mfrac></mfenced><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>4</mn><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>17</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><munder><mi>lim</mi><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow></munder><mfrac><mrow><mfenced><mrow><mi>a</mi><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mi>c</mi><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mrow></mfenced><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mfenced><mfrac><mrow><msup><mi>a</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>b</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>c</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mfenced><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mo>&#8230;</mo></mrow><mrow><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>4</mn><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>17</mn></math></p><p>Now for limit to exist,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>a</mi><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mi>c</mi><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>c</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>a</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><munder><mi>lim</mi><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow></munder><mfrac><mrow><mfenced><mfrac><mrow><msup><mi>a</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>b</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>c</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mfenced><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mo>&#8230;</mo></mrow><mrow><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>4</mn><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>17</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mfrac><mrow><msup><mi>a</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>b</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>c</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><mn>4</mn></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>17</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><msup><mi>a</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>b</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn><msup><mi>a</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>68</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mn>5</mn><msup><mi>a</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>b</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>68</mn></math></p><p>Hence this is the correct option.</p></blockquote>"
